    <!-- v0.8.0: integrated Wallpaper Engine -->
    <!-- v0.8.13: the live wallpaper service's label. Android resolves the
         name shown in the system wallpaper picker from the SERVICE label,
         which was the app name ("WallpaperSuite") — the workshop's own
         client names its entry "Wallpaper Engine", so ours matches that.
         Note: Android live wallpaper labels are STATIC resources — no app
         can show the current wallpaper's workshop title there. -->
